{"seq":3,"slug":"api-gateway-rate-limiting","title":"API 网关限流：在基础设施层统一管控","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/api-rate-limiting-patterns/implementation/api-gateway-rate-limiting","wordCount":822,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"api-网关限流-在基础设施层统一管控\">API 网关限流：在基础设施层统一管控</h1><p>API 网关是流量进入系统的第一道门。在网关层实现限流的优势在于：无需修改任何业务代码，限流策略可以集中管理，且对所有后端服务统一生效。本文深入 Nginx、Kong 和主流云网关的限流配置实践。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>API 网关是流量进入系统的第一道门，在网关层实现限流可以做到<strong>无需修改业务代码、集中管理、统一生效</strong>。三类主流方案覆盖不同的基础设施层次：Nginx 适合自建服务器、Kong 适合微服务架构、云网关（AWS/GCP）适合云原生部署。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方案</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>存储</th>\n<th>动态配置</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Nginx limit_req</td>\n<td>自建服务器</td>\n<td>本地共享内存</td>\n<td>需重载配置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Kong 插件</td>\n<td>微服务网关</td>\n<td>Redis（分布式）</td>\n<td>Admin API 热更新</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AWS API Gateway</td>\n<td>云原生</td>\n<td>托管（透明）</td>\n<td>CloudFormation/CDK</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Envoy/Istio</td>\n<td>Service Mesh</td>\n<td>Redis + xDS</td>\n<td>声明式动态</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"为什么在网关层限流\">为什么在网关层限流</h2><p>在业务代码层实现限流（中间件、Filter）有两个系统性问题：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>重复实现</strong>：每个服务需要独立引入限流依赖、配置参数，维护分散</li>\n<li><strong>绕过风险</strong>：恶意请求可能直接访问未部署中间件的服务实例</li>\n</ol>\n<p>网关层限流的优势：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>应用层限流</th>\n<th>网关层限流</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>维护成本</td>\n<td>每服务配置</td>\n<td>集中一处</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>计算开销</td>\n<td>占用业务资源</td>\n<td>独立处理节点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>覆盖范围</td>\n<td>可能有遗漏</td>\n<td>全量拦截</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>动态更新</td>\n<td>需重启服务</td>\n<td>热更新配置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可观测性</td>\n<td>分散日志</td>\n<td>统一监控</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"nginx-限流配置\">Nginx 限流配置</h2><p>Nginx 原生支持两种限流模块：<code>ngx_http_limit_req_module</code>（请求速率）和 <code>ngx_http_limit_conn_module</code>（并发连接数）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"基本速率限流\">基本速率限流</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"nginx\" data-code=\"# nginx.conf&#10;&#10;http {&#10;  # 定义限流区：以 $binary_remote_addr（IP）为键&#10;  # 10m 为共享内存区大小，可存约 16 万个状态&#10;  # rate=10r/s 为每秒最多 10 个请求&#10;  limit_req_zone $binary_remote_addr zone=api_ip:10m rate=10r/s;&#10;&#10;  # 以用户 ID（从 Header 提取）为键的用户级限流&#10;  limit_req_zone $http_x_user_id zone=api_user:10m rate=60r/m;&#10;&#10;  server {&#10;    location /api/ {&#10;      # burst=20：允许突发 20 个请求排队（漏桶效果）&#10;      # nodelay：突发请求立即处理而非按速率延迟&#10;      limit_req zone=api_ip burst=20 nodelay;&#10;      limit_req zone=api_user burst=10 nodelay;&#10;&#10;      # 超限时返回 429（默认是 503）&#10;      limit_req_status 429;&#10;&#10;      proxy_pass http://backend;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    # 敏感接口：更严格的限制&#10;    location /api/auth/login {&#10;      limit_req zone=api_ip burst=5;&#10;      limit_req_status 429;&#10;      proxy_pass http://backend;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># nginx.conf</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>http {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  # 定义限流区：以 $binary_remote_addr（IP）为键</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  # 10m 为共享内存区大小，可存约 16 万个状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  # rate=10r/s 为每秒最多 10 个请求</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  limit_req_zone $binary_remote_addr zone=api_ip:10m rate=10r/s;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  # 以用户 ID（从 Header 提取）为键的用户级限流</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  limit_req_zone $http_x_user_id zone=api_user:10m rate=60r/m;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  server {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    location /api/ {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      # burst=20：允许突发 20 个请求排队（漏桶效果）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      # nodelay：突发请求立即处理而非按速率延迟</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      limit_req zone=api_ip burst=20 nodelay;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      limit_req zone=api_user burst=10 nodelay;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      # 超限时返回 429（默认是 503）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      limit_req_status 429;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      proxy_pass http://backend;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    # 敏感接口：更严格的限制</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    location /api/auth/login {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      limit_req zone=api_ip burst=5;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      limit_req_status 429;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      proxy_pass http://backend;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"动态设置-retry-after-header\">动态设置 Retry-After Header</h3><p>Nginx 默认不设置 <code>Retry-After</code>，需要通过 <code>limit_req_dry_run</code> 和 Lua 扩展添加：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"nginx\" data-code=\"location /api/ {&#10;  limit_req zone=api_ip burst=20 nodelay;&#10;  limit_req_status 429;&#10;&#10;  # 超限时添加标准 Header&#10;  header_filter_by_lua_block {&#10;    if ngx.status == 429 then&#10;      ngx.header[&#39;Retry-After&#39;] = &#39;60&#39;&#10;      ngx.header[&#39;X-RateLimit-Limit&#39;] = &#39;10&#39;&#10;    end&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>location /api/ {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  limit_req zone=api_ip burst=20 nodelay;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  limit_req_status 429;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  # 超限时添加标准 Header</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  header_filter_by_lua_block {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if ngx.status == 429 then</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      ngx.header['Retry-After'] = '60'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      ngx.header['X-RateLimit-Limit'] = '10'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"kong-网关限流插件\">Kong 网关限流插件</h2><p>Kong 提供开箱即用的 <code>rate-limiting</code> 插件，支持 Redis 集群存储，适合微服务架构。</p>\n<h3 id=\"全局启用\">全局启用</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# kong.yaml (声明式配置)&#10;plugins:&#10;  - name: rate-limiting&#10;    config:&#10;      second: null&#10;      minute: 100 # 每分钟 100 请求&#10;      hour: 5000 # 每小时 5000 请求&#10;      day: null&#10;      policy: redis # 使用 Redis 存储（分布式）&#10;      redis_host: redis.internal&#10;      redis_port: 6379&#10;      limit_by: consumer # 按消费者（认证用户）限流&#10;      hide_client_headers: false # 保留 X-RateLimit-* 响应头\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># kong.yaml (声明式配置)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">plugins</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">rate-limiting</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    config</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      second</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      minute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 每分钟 100 请求</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      hour</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5000</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 每小时 5000 请求</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      day</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      policy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">redis</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 使用 Redis 存储（分布式）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      redis_host</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">redis.internal</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      redis_port</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6379</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      limit_by</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">consumer</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 按消费者（认证用户）限流</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      hide_client_headers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 保留 X-RateLimit-* 响应头</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"路由级配置\">路由级配置</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"routes:&#10;  - name: search-api&#10;    paths:&#10;      - /api/search&#10;    plugins:&#10;      - name: rate-limiting&#10;        config:&#10;          minute: 30 # 搜索接口更严格&#10;          policy: redis&#10;          limit_by: consumer&#10;&#10;  - name: export-api&#10;    paths:&#10;      - /api/export&#10;    plugins:&#10;      - name: rate-limiting&#10;        config:&#10;          minute: 5 # 导出接口极严格&#10;          hour: 20&#10;          policy: redis&#10;          limit_by: consumer\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">routes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">search-api</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    paths</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/api/search</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    plugins</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">rate-limiting</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        config</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          minute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 搜索接口更严格</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          policy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">redis</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          limit_by</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">consumer</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">export-api</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    paths</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/api/export</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    plugins</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">rate-limiting</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        config</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          minute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 导出接口极严格</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          hour</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          policy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">redis</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          limit_by</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">consumer</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"kong-响应-header-格式\">Kong 响应 Header 格式</h3><p>Kong 自动注入以下 Header：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"http\" data-code=\"HTTP/1.1 200 OK&#10;X-RateLimit-Limit-Minute: 100&#10;X-RateLimit-Remaining-Minute: 97&#10;RateLimit-Limit: 100&#10;RateLimit-Remaining: 97&#10;RateLimit-Reset: 1720080060\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>HTTP/1.1 200 OK</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>X-RateLimit-Limit-Minute: 100</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>X-RateLimit-Remaining-Minute: 97</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RateLimit-Limit: 100</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RateLimit-Remaining: 97</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RateLimit-Reset: 1720080060</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"云平台网关限流\">云平台网关限流</h2><h3 id=\"aws-api-gateway\">AWS API Gateway</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"// 通过 CloudFormation/CDK 配置&#10;const api = new apigateway.RestApi(this, &#39;MyApi&#39;, {&#10;  defaultMethodOptions: {&#10;    throttlingBurstLimit: 100, // 令牌桶容量&#10;    throttlingRateLimit: 50, // 每秒填充速率&#10;  },&#10;});&#10;&#10;// 使用计划（Usage Plan）实现差异化限流&#10;const usagePlan = api.addUsagePlan(&#39;BasicPlan&#39;, {&#10;  throttle: {&#10;    burstLimit: 50,&#10;    rateLimit: 10,&#10;  },&#10;  quota: {&#10;    limit: 10000,&#10;    period: apigateway.Period.MONTH,&#10;  },&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 通过 CloudFormation/CDK 配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> api</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> apigateway.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">RestApi</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'MyApi'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  defaultMethodOptions: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    throttlingBurstLimit: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 令牌桶容量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    throttlingRateLimit: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 每秒填充速率</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 使用计划（Usage Plan）实现差异化限流</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> usagePlan</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> api.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">addUsagePlan</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'BasicPlan'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  throttle: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    burstLimit: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    rateLimit: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  quota: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    limit: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    period: apigateway.Period.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">MONTH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"动态限流配置-admin-api\">动态限流配置：Admin API</h3><p>生产系统需要不重启服务就能调整限流参数。Kong 和大多数现代网关提供 Admin API：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"// 动态调整特定用户的限流配置&#10;async function adjustUserLimit(userId, newLimit) {&#10;  const response = await fetch(`http://kong-admin:8001/consumers/${userId}/plugins`, {&#10;    method: &#39;POST&#39;,&#10;    headers: { &#39;Content-Type&#39;: &#39;application/json&#39; },&#10;    body: JSON.stringify({&#10;      name: &#39;rate-limiting&#39;,&#10;      config: {&#10;        minute: newLimit,&#10;        policy: &#39;redis&#39;,&#10;        limit_by: &#39;consumer&#39;,&#10;      },&#10;    }),&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  if (!response.ok) {&#10;    throw new Error(`Failed to update rate limit: ${response.status}`);&#10;  }&#10;  return response.json();&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 动态调整特定用户的限流配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> adjustUserLimit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">userId</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">newLimit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> response</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`http://kong-admin:8001/consumers/${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">userId</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}/plugins`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    method: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'POST'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    headers: { </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Content-Type'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'application/json'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    body: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">JSON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">stringify</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'rate-limiting'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      config: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        minute: newLimit,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        policy: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'redis'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        limit_by: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'consumer'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">response.ok) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    throw</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`Failed to update rate limit: ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">response</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">status</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> response.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">json</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"限流监控与告警\">限流监控与告警</h2><p>网关层的限流数据是系统健康的重要指标：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[网关限流日志] --&gt; B[日志聚合&lt;br/&gt;Elasticsearch/Loki]&#10;    B --&gt; C{告警规则}&#10;    C -- &quot;429 率 &gt; 5%&quot; --&gt; D[触发告警&lt;br/&gt;配额可能过严]&#10;    C -- &quot;429 率 &gt; 50%&quot; --&gt; E[触发告警&lt;br/&gt;可能遭受攻击]&#10;    C -- &quot;特定用户 100% 429&quot; --&gt; F[通知用户&lt;br/&gt;升级套餐提示]&#10;    B --&gt; G[Grafana 仪表盘]&#10;    G --&gt; H[429 趋势图]&#10;    G --&gt; I[Top 被限流用户]&#10;    G --&gt; J[接口维度分布]\">graph LR\n    A[网关限流日志] --&gt; B[日志聚合&lt;br/&gt;Elasticsearch/Loki]\n    B --&gt; C{告警规则}\n    C -- \"429 率 &gt; 5%\" --&gt; D[触发告警&lt;br/&gt;配额可能过严]\n    C -- \"429 率 &gt; 50%\" --&gt; E[触发告警&lt;br/&gt;可能遭受攻击]\n    C -- \"特定用户 100% 429\" --&gt; F[通知用户&lt;br/&gt;升级套餐提示]\n    B --&gt; G[Grafana 仪表盘]\n    G --&gt; H[429 趋势图]\n    G --&gt; I[Top 被限流用户]\n    G --&gt; J[接口维度分布]</pre><p>关键监控指标：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>告警阈值</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>rate_limit_hit_rate</code></td>\n<td>&gt; 5%</td>\n<td>配额可能设置过严</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>rate_limit_hit_rate</code></td>\n<td>&gt; 30%</td>\n<td>可能遭受攻击或爬虫</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>top_limited_users</code></td>\n<td>单用户 &gt; 80%</td>\n<td>该用户可能需要升级套餐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>gateway_latency_p99</code></td>\n<td>&gt; 50ms</td>\n<td>限流检查本身有性能问题</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>网关层限流优于应用层：集中管理、全量拦截、零代码修改</li>\n<li>Nginx 适合自建基础设施，<code>limit_req_zone</code> 配合 <code>burst</code> 实现令牌桶效果</li>\n<li>Kong 插件系统开箱即用，支持 Redis 分布式存储和消费者级别的差异化限流</li>\n<li>动态配置 Admin API 是生产必备，不依赖重启即可调整限流参数</li>\n<li>监控 429 率是发现攻击和配额问题的第一手段</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p>兄弟文档：<a href=\"distributed-rate-limiting\">分布式限流</a> 讲解网关背后的 Redis 一致性实现；第三章 <a href=\"../patterns/user-tier-quota\">用户分级配额</a> 介绍如何在网关策略中映射业务套餐。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"API 网关限流：在基础设施层统一管控","id":"api-网关限流-在基础设施层统一管控"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么在网关层限流","id":"为什么在网关层限流"},{"level":2,"text":"Nginx 限流配置","id":"nginx-限流配置"},{"level":3,"text":"基本速率限流","id":"基本速率限流"},{"level":3,"text":"动态设置 Retry-After Header","id":"动态设置-retry-after-header"},{"level":2,"text":"Kong 网关限流插件","id":"kong-网关限流插件"},{"level":3,"text":"全局启用","id":"全局启用"},{"level":3,"text":"路由级配置","id":"路由级配置"},{"level":3,"text":"Kong 响应 Header 格式","id":"kong-响应-header-格式"},{"level":2,"text":"云平台网关限流","id":"云平台网关限流"},{"level":3,"text":"AWS API Gateway","id":"aws-api-gateway"},{"level":3,"text":"动态限流配置：Admin API","id":"动态限流配置-admin-api"},{"level":2,"text":"限流监控与告警","id":"限流监控与告警"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"分布式限流：多实例环境下的一致性挑战","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/api-rate-limiting-patterns/implementation/distributed-rate-limiting"},"next":{"title":"用户分级配额：将限流策略与商业模式绑定","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/api-rate-limiting-patterns/patterns/user-tier-quota"}}